{"type":"message","id":"fe2cfa8a","parentId":"aa6e2583","timestamp":"2026-03-03T09:01:34.305Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Tue 2026-03-03 17:01 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/2). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: # cgnsMeshCutter 项目 - 阶段一：修复阻塞性 Bug\n\n## 项目信息\n- **工作目录:** `/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter`\n- **技术栈:** CMake + G++ (C++11)\n- **测试文件:** `build/pipe.yaml` + `build/pipe.cgns`\n\n## 阶段一任务：修复 6 个高优先级 Bug\n\n根据审查报告 `/home/one/.openclaw-reports/review-agent/2026-03-03-cgnsMeshCutter-review.md`，修复以下问题：\n\n1. **`__GUNC__` 拼写错误** → `__GNUC__` (src/cartesianCutter.cpp:24)\n2. **`BoundBox::min/max` 返回值缺失** (src/cartesianCutter.cpp:31-52) - 未定义行为\n3. **裸指针内存管理** → 改用 RAII (src/cartesianCutter.cpp:103-106, cgFile.cpp:25-28)\n4. **`sprintf` 缓冲区溢出** → `snprintf` (src/cartesianCutter.cpp:531-532 等)\n5. **Metis 条件编译类型定义** (src/metisCutter.h:8-10)\n6. **`exit()` 错误处理** → 改用异常 (src/cgFile.cpp:36-43)\n\n## 验收标准\n\n每个修复后都要验证代码可用：\n\n```bash\ncd /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/build\ncmake .. && make -j\n\n# ParMetis 验证（cutter 并行运行）\nmpirun -n 2 ./cutter.exe -m pipe.cgns -np 2\nmpirun -n 2 /home/one/app/act/incomACT.exe -c pipe.yaml\n```\n\n**通过标准:** 编译无警告，CFD 计算收敛\n\n## 工作流程\n\n1. 阅读审查报告，理解所有高优先级问题\n2. 逐个修复 bug，每次修复后编译测试\n3. 所有修复完成后，跑完整验证流程\n4. 提交阶段一成果，准备阶段二\n\n## 团队协作\n\n如需代码实现，spawn code-agent；如需测试验证，spawn test-agent。"}],"timestamp":1772528494302}}
